            make_q("Why does Batch Normalization struggle when mini-batch sizes are very small (e.g. 2 or 4)?", ["The batch mean and variance become extremely noisy and inaccurate estimates of the true population statistics", "GPU memory overflows", "Gradients become exactly zero", "Epsilon cannot be added"], 0, "With batch sizes like 2 or 4, sample variance estimates fluctuate wildly, introducing destabilizing noise into training."),
